SUMMARY:FCR featuring Carolyn Dutton
DESCRIPTION:Featuring the timeless hits of Crosby\, Stills\, Nash & Young\, Bob Dylan\, The Beatles\, and More! \nFCR is a musical collaboration between Frank Jones\, Rick Clayton\, and Chuck Wills\, reinterpreting songs from your favorite classic artists. With tight 3-part harmonies\, these multi-instrumentalists often include cello\, upright bass\, and slide guitar in their shows. Carolyn Dutton joins them on violin for what will be a memorable musical journey. \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/fcr-featuring-carolyn-dutton-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Blues,Clasic Rock,Country,Featured Event,Fingerstyle,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-FCR_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
