SUMMARY:The Amazing Dennis Experience
DESCRIPTION:Experience an unforgettable afternoon of laugh-out-loud comedy\, astonishing sleight-of-hand\, and impossible magic happening right before your eyes! \nThe Amazing Dennis Experience blends world-class magic\, hilarious storytelling\, and plenty of audience participation into a fast-paced show the whole family can enjoy. \nAnd for the grand finale… The Amazing Dennis will do the impossible and magically make Santa Claus appear on center stage!\nThis is one holiday magic show your family won’t soon forget. Get your tickets today! \n \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/the-amazing-dennis-experience-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Christmas,Comedy,Featured Event,Magic
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-DennisMagic_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
