SUMMARY:White Christmas [Live Musical Theatre]
DESCRIPTION:Irving Berlin’s White Christmas is a heartwarming stage musical about two World War II army veterans turned song-and-dance partners who team up with a sister act to save a struggling Vermont lodge owned by their former general. \n\n\n\n\n\nCAST LIST \nBOB WALLACE – Alexus McLeod\nPHIL DAVIS – Romeo Morgan\nBETTY HAYNES – Jessica Pumo\nJUDY HAYNES – Anna Bratton\nGENERAL WAVERLY – Ed Phillips\nMARTHA WATSON – Nicole Cunningham\nSUSAN WAVERLY – Kaira Lammers\nRALPH SHELDRAKE/EZIKIEL FOSTER/SNORING MAN – Brian Heaton\nRITA/DANCE CAPTAIN – One Griffin\nRHODA – Erin Rudich\nMIKE (STAGE MANAGER) – Muriel Mackie\nTESSIE – Jenny Endicott\nJIMMY/TRAIN CONDUCTOR/ED SULLIVAN ANNOUNCER – Tom Preston\nCIGARETTE GIRL – Chloe Allen\nMRS. SNORING MAN/SEAMSTRESS – Julie Miller\nASSISTANT SEAMSTRESS – Amanda Middleton\nOFFSTAGE ANNOUNCERS – Mark Owens\nSWINGS – Derek Middleton\, Ben Richards\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS - Friday Dec 4 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Saturday Dec 5 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Sunday Dec 6 - 2:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Friday Dec 11 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Saturday Dec 12 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Sunday Dec 13 - 2:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Friday Dec 18 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Saturday Dec 19 - 7:30pm\n\nBUY TICKETS - Sunday Dec 20 - 2:30pm
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/white-christmas-live-musical-theatre/2026-12-04/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Live Shows,Play,Theatre
